### Phase 10: Backend — Service & API
- [x] T10.1 Add `startGame(code: string)` in `backend/src/services/roomStore.ts`
  - [x] Validates room exists and has >= 2 participants
  - [x] Sets `status = "playing"`, `drawerId = room.hostId`, `secretWord = STARTER_WORDS[0]`
- [x] T10.2 Update `toRoomSnapshot` to only include `secretWord` if `viewerParticipantId === room.drawerId`
- [x] T10.3 Add `POST /rooms/:code/start` endpoint in `backend/src/api/rooms.ts`
