### Phase 12: Frontend — UI Implementation
- [x] T12.1 `LobbyPage.tsx`: Hook up "Start Game" button to call `roomStore.startGame(room.code)`
- [x] T12.2 `LobbyPage.tsx`: Add redirect to `/game` if `room.status === "playing"`
